---
const options=[
 {name:'Launch a website',intro:'For a new business or a first professional website.',items:['Plan your pages and customer journey','Responsive design and development','Contact form and search foundations'],service:'Web design & development'},
 {name:'Redesign your website',intro:'For an existing site that needs a clearer message and better experience.',items:['Review existing pages and content','Refresh layouts and enquiry paths','Plan retained URLs and redirects'],service:'Web design & development'},
 {name:'Support your website',intro:'For a website that needs ongoing attention or targeted improvements.',items:['Discuss updates and technical issues','Prioritise performance and usability','Agree the scope of ongoing support'],service:'Custom support'}
];
---
<section class="section wrap" id="project-options" aria-labelledby="options-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Choose your next step</p><h2 id="options-title">A clear plan.<br /><em>A useful website.</em></h2></div><p>Choose the starting point that fits. We’ll discuss your pages, content, budget and timing before agreeing the scope and quote.</p></div><div class="options-grid">{options.map(option=><article><h3>{option.name}</h3><p>{option.intro}</p><ul>{option.items.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul><a class="button" href={'/?service='+encodeURIComponent(option.service)+'#enquiry'}>Discuss this option<span class="sr-only">: {option.name}</span></a></article>)}</div><p class="scope-note">Your proposal will confirm inclusions, responsibilities, timing and ongoing costs. Hosting, domain renewal, email and external software are discussed separately where relevant.</p></section>
<section class="section wrap rebuild" aria-labelledby="rebuild-title"><p class="eyebrow">Inside a real project / Our own website</p><div class="section-head"><h2 id="rebuild-title">CodeMax,<br /><em>rebuilt with purpose.</em></h2><p>A working example of a redesign that brings existing content into a new experience.</p></div><div class="rebuild-grid"><div><h3>The brief</h3><p>Refresh the design and enquiry experience while keeping the existing article collection accessible.</p></div><div><h3>The work</h3><p>Responsive pages, imported articles at their original URLs, a spam-protected contact form and scheduled publishing.</p></div><div><h3>The result</h3><p>A deployed website with connected enquiry delivery and a browsable article archive. Search rankings and lead growth are still being measured.</p></div></div><a class="text-link" href="/services/web-design-melbourne/">Explore the redesign approach</a></section>
<style>
/* These sections sit on the dark body, unlike the light service panels. */
.section-head>p{color:#c4c8bc}
.options-grid,.rebuild-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}.options-grid article{padding:28px;border:1px solid #aaa99e;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px}.options-grid ul{padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 10px}.options-grid li{margin-bottom:10px}.options-grid .button{margin-top:auto;background:var(--orange);color:var(--ink);border:2px solid var(--ink)}.options-grid .button:hover{background:#ff754d;color:var(--ink)}.options-grid .button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:4px}.scope-note{margin-top:22px;color:#c4c8bc;font-size:14px}.rebuild{border-top:3px solid var(--orange)}.rebuild-grid{margin-bottom:28px}.rebuild h3{margin-bottom:14px}.rebuild p{line-height:1.65}h2 em{color:#bd3514}@media(max-width:800px){.options-grid,.rebuild-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.options-grid article{padding:24px}.rebuild-grid{gap:26px}}
</style>
